id=pico4-steamlink-velfix
name=Pico 4 Steam Link Head-Velocity Fix
version=v1.1
versionCode=101
author=UbootVRC
description=Fixes the Steam Link head wobble after recenter by replacing the forwarded head linear velocity with a position-derived one (OpenXR xrLocateSpace hook, derived35 approach). Version-independent: use official Steam Link, no APK patch. Scoped to Steam Link only. Needs Zygisk. Tune via /data/local/tmp/pico4velfix-corr "mode window_ms" (default 1 35; 0=off).
